---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const TREC_CN = 'https://www.trec.texas.gov/sites/default/files/pdf-forms/CN%201-4-1_1.pdf';
const TREC_IABS = 'https://www.trec.texas.gov/sites/default/files/pdf-forms/IABS%201-0.pdf';
---
<Base
  title="Broker compliance review | Ling Jordan"
  description="Internal compliance summary for broker review."
  path="/broker-review"
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="wrap section narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Internal &mdash; not indexed, not linked publicly</p>
    <h1>Broker compliance review</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      A summary of how this site is built to satisfy TREC advertising rules,
      prepared for review and sign-off by Golden Realty before launch.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap section narrow">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">1. Broker identification</h2>
      <p>
        Golden Realty (H &amp; W Golden Horse Inc, Broker License #9010147)
        appears in the footer of <strong>every page</strong> of the site,
        including all translated pages, together with the office address and
        office phone number.
      </p>
      <p>
        The site does not present itself as a brokerage. A standing disclaimer in
        the footer states that Ling Jordan is a licensed sales agent sponsored by
        Golden Realty and is not a licensed broker.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Licensee name</h2>
      <p>
        The footer uses the full licensed name, <strong>Xueling Jordan</strong>,
        with TREC License #693195. The display name &ldquo;Ling Jordan&rdquo; is
        used in headings and navigation.
      </p>
      <p class="notice">
        <strong>Action required before launch.</strong> Confirm that
        &ldquo;Ling&rdquo; is either registered with TREC as an alternate name or
        qualifies as an exempt derivative nickname of &ldquo;Xueling.&rdquo;
        Registration is filed through the licensee's TREC online account.
        This has not been verified.
      </p>

      <h2>3. No team or firm name</h2>
      <p>
        TREC prohibits a team name from implying a separate brokerage and
        requires it to include &ldquo;team&rdquo; or &ldquo;group.&rdquo; The
        phrase &ldquo;XNJ Real Estate&rdquo; is therefore <strong>never
        displayed anywhere on the site</strong> as a business or team name.
      </p>
      <p>
        &ldquo;XNJ&rdquo; appears only as a personal monogram in the logo mark,
        in the same way an agent's initials appear on a sign. The domain
        <code>xnjrealestate.com</code> functions as a web address, not as an
        advertised business name.
      </p>
      <p class="notice">
        <strong>Requested confirmation.</strong> Broker approval that the
        monogram mark and domain, combined with individual-name branding, meet
        Golden Realty's compliance standard.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Required notices</h2>
      <p>Both notices are linked in the footer of every page:</p>
      <ul class="clean">
        <li><a href={TREC_CN}>TREC Consumer Protection Notice</a></li>
        <li><a href={TREC_IABS}>Information About Brokerage Services (IABS)</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="notice">
        If Golden Realty maintains its own completed IABS form, supply it and the
        link will be repointed to the brokerage's version.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Fair housing</h2>
      <p>
        The Equal Housing Opportunity statement appears in the footer of every
        page. Language capability is described as a <em>service offered</em>
        &mdash; &ldquo;service in English and Mandarin&rdquo; &mdash; and the
        site never targets, names, or appears to steer by national origin, race,
        religion, familial status, or any other protected class.
      </p>
      <p>
        Neighborhood guides describe school <em>zoning</em> and district
        boundaries. They do not rank schools or characterize the demographics of
        any area.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Accuracy and claims</h2>
      <p>
        The site makes no production claims, no award claims, and no
        &ldquo;#1&rdquo; or superlative claims of any kind. Property data will be
        sourced from NTREIS through a licensed IDX vendor, with the standard
        disclaimer that information is deemed reliable but not guaranteed.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every unverified figure is currently marked as a placeholder and will not
        be published until confirmed.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Outstanding items before launch</h2>
      <ul class="clean">
        <li>Alternate name &ldquo;Ling&rdquo; registered with TREC, or confirmed exempt</li>
        <li>Broker approval of this independent website</li>
        <li>Broker approval of the XNJ monogram mark</li>
        <li>Brokerage IABS form supplied, if Golden Realty uses its own</li>
        <li>Property management fee schedule confirmed and published</li>
        <li>IDX vendor confirmed to support NTREIS, with license agreement executed</li>
        <li>Broker review of all page copy prior to publication</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band-jade">
    <div class="wrap section narrow">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Questions on any of the above</h2>
      <p style="margin:0">
        Contact Ling Jordan directly at 972-815-7644 or
        <a href="mailto:ling@xnjrealestate.com">ling@xnjrealestate.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
